@*
    Contracts -- Asset & Contract Management, Phase 5.1 (migration 434).
    Rendered from Manage.cshtml when Model.Key == "asset-contracts".

    BRD 7: one contract record per agreement (contract ID, name, type from
    the organization coverage type list, parent agreement, vendor from the
    Vendor Module). BRD 7.2: every revision is a ContractVersion -- Draft,
    In Review, Pending Approval, Approved, Active, Superseded, Expired,
    Terminated, Rejected; only a Draft is editable, an approved version is
    immutable, a new version replaces the previous one on its effective
    date. The contract dialog shows the 7.2.3 subsections: current summary,
    version history (open any version read-only, compare two versions),
    vendor contacts, documents, approval history and vendor contact
    history. BRD 7.4: vendor contacts are the vendor users (third-party
    people of the vendor), mapped by role with effective dates; another
    person validates a mapping; ending keeps it. Every rule is enforced by
    the procedures (sp_asset_contract_*); this screen mirrors them.

    435 (BRD 7 Coverage, 5.1.11, 5.2.14): a version also holds its
    entitlements (product / SKU, quantity, dates, exclusions) and its asset
    coverage (one line per asset and coverage type: Covered, Excluded with
    a reason, or Suspended), edited while the version is a Draft and frozen
    with it. "Coverage gaps" lists assets missing coverage their asset type
    requires; "Coverage requirements" sets per asset type which coverage is
    Not applicable / Optional / Required and whether a gap blocks
    activation, plus the expiring window. The contract dialog shows the
    current coverage posture and the coverage history per version; the
    comparison lists asset coverage and entitlement differences.

    436 (BRD 7.3): "Renewals" lists the contracts reaching their renewal
    date (earliest of notice date, decision date and end minus the expiring
    window) and the renewal occurrences. A renewal records the decision
    (renewal, extension, rebid, replacement, non-renewal), new expiry,
    value and quotation / PO / invoice references; another person approves
    the decision; the resulting version is created (renewal / extension)
    or linked (rebid / replacement) and approved as usual; completing the
    renewal freezes the coverage reconciliation (covered, added, removed,
    excluded, unresolved) and derives the outcome. Unresolved assets are
    resolved one by one. The contract dialog shows the Renewal history.

    Backend: practice/api/asset-config/contracts... (AssetConfigController)
    Script : wwwroot/js/AssetConfig/asset-contracts.js
*@
@model PracticeManagement.Web.Models.PracticeScreen
@{
    var acoPermissions = ViewBag.Permissions as string[] ?? [];
    bool acoHas(string action) => acoPermissions.Any(p => p.Equals(action, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) || p == "*");
    var acoCanAdd = acoHas("ADD");
    var acoCanEdit = acoHas("EDIT");
    var acoCanApprove = acoHas("APPROVE");
}

<div class="pm-page-heading compact">
    <div>
        <p class="pm-eyebrow">@Model.Group / @Model.Title</p>
        <h1>@Model.Title</h1>
        <p>@Model.Description</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="acoRoot" data-can-add="@(acoCanAdd ? "1" : "0")" data-can-edit="@(acoCanEdit ? "1" : "0")" data-can-approve="@(acoCanApprove ? "1" : "0")">
    <section class="pm-panel">
        <div class="pm-toolbar">
            <select id="acoOrg" title="Organization"><option value="">Select organization</option></select>
        </div>
        <div class="pm-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Contracts">
            <button role="tab" class="active" data-aco-main="CONTRACTS" aria-selected="true">Contracts</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-main="RENEWALS" aria-selected="false">Renewals</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-main="GAPS" aria-selected="false">Coverage gaps</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-main="REQUIREMENTS" aria-selected="false">Coverage requirements</button>
        </div>
        <p class="pm-message" id="acoMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-mainpanel="CONTRACTS">
        <div class="pm-toolbar">
            <input type="search" id="acoSearch" placeholder="Search contract ID, name or vendor" maxlength="200" />
            <select id="acoStatus" title="Status">
                <option value="">All statuses</option>
                <option value="DRAFT">Draft</option>
                <option value="APPROVED">Approved (not yet effective)</option>
                <option value="ACTIVE">Active</option>
                <option value="EXPIRED">Expired</option>
                <option value="TERMINATED">Terminated</option>
            </select>
            <select id="acoVendorFilter" title="Vendor"><option value="">All vendors</option></select>
            <select id="acoTypeFilter" title="Contract type"><option value="">All types</option></select>
            <button class="pm-button icon" id="acoRefresh" type="button" title="Refresh" aria-label="Refresh"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i></button>
            @if (acoCanAdd)
            {
                <button class="pm-button primary" id="acoNew" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> New contract</button>
            }
        </div>
        <div class="pm-table-wrap">
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>Contract</th><th>Type</th><th>Vendor</th><th>Status</th><th>Current version</th><th>Effective</th><th>Value</th><th>Owner</th><th>In progress</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="acoListBody"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <div id="acoPager"></div>
        </div>

        @* ---------------- renewals (436) ---------------- *@
        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-mainpanel="RENEWALS" hidden>
            <h3 class="aco-sub">Due for renewal</h3>
            <div class="pm-toolbar">
                <select id="acoDueWithin" title="Due within">
                    <option value="30">Due within 30 days</option><option value="60">Due within 60 days</option>
                    <option value="90" selected>Due within 90 days</option><option value="180">Due within 180 days</option>
                    <option value="365">Due within a year</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Contract</th><th>Vendor</th><th>Status</th><th>Version in force</th><th>Ends</th><th>Renewal due</th><th>Owner</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoDueBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <h3 class="aco-sub">Renewal occurrences</h3>
            <div class="pm-toolbar">
                <select id="acoRenStatus" title="Status">
                    <option value="OPEN_ALL">Open</option><option value="">All</option>
                    <option value="COMPLETED">Completed</option><option value="CANCELLED">Cancelled</option>
                </select>
                <input type="search" id="acoRenSearch" placeholder="Search occurrence, contract or vendor" maxlength="200" />
            </div>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Occurrence</th><th>Contract</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th><th>Due</th><th>Old / new expiry</th><th>Value</th><th>Outcome</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoRenBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <div id="acoRenPager"></div>
        </div>

        @* ---------------- coverage gaps (435) ---------------- *@
        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-mainpanel="GAPS" hidden>
            <div class="pm-toolbar">
                <input type="search" id="acoGapSearch" placeholder="Search asset or asset type" maxlength="200" />
                <select id="acoGapType" title="Coverage type"><option value="">All coverage types</option></select>
            </div>
            <p class="aco-note">Active assets whose asset type requires a coverage type that is not covered (or is covered for less than the minimum period). Map them on a contract version, or change the requirement.</p>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Asset</th><th>Asset type</th><th>Coverage type</th><th>Status</th><th>Gap</th><th>On a gap</th><th>Contract</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoGapBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <div id="acoGapPager"></div>
        </div>

        @* ---------------- coverage requirements (435) ---------------- *@
        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-mainpanel="REQUIREMENTS" hidden>
            <div class="pm-form-grid">
                <label><span>Expiring window (days before coverage end)</span><input type="number" id="acoSetWindow" min="1" max="365" /></label>
                @if (acoCanEdit)
                {
                    <div><span>&nbsp;</span><button class="pm-button" id="acoSetSave" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save window</button></div>
                }
            </div>
            <p class="aco-note">Coverage shows Expiring from the earliest of the contract notice date, the decision date and the coverage end minus this window.</p>
            <div class="pm-toolbar">
                <select id="acoReqType" title="Asset type"></select>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Coverage type</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Minimum period (months)</th><th>Licence handling</th><th>On a gap</th><th>Notes</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoReqBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

@* ======================= Contract dialog (7.2.3) ======================= *@
<div class="pm-modal" id="acoModal" hidden>
    <div class="pm-modal-panel aco-wide">
        <header>
            <h2 id="acoTitle">Contract</h2>
            <button class="pm-modal-close" type="button" data-close-aco="acoModal" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </header>
        <div class="pm-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Contract">
            <button role="tab" class="active" data-aco-tab="SUMMARY" aria-selected="true">Current summary</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-tab="VERSIONS" aria-selected="false">Version history</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-tab="CONTACTS" aria-selected="false">Vendor contacts</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-tab="DOCUMENTS" aria-selected="false">Documents</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-tab="APPROVALS" aria-selected="false">Approval history</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-tab="CONTACTHISTORY" aria-selected="false">Vendor contact history</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-tab="COVERAGEHISTORY" aria-selected="false">Coverage history</button>
            <button role="tab" data-aco-tab="RENEWALHISTORY" aria-selected="false">Renewal history</button>
        </div>
        <p class="pm-message" id="acoDetailMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>

        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-panel="SUMMARY">
            <div class="aco-info" id="acoSummary"></div>
            <h3 class="aco-sub">Current coverage posture</h3>
            <div class="aco-actions" id="acoPosture"></div>
            <div id="acoWarnings" hidden>
                <h3 class="aco-sub">Before approval</h3>
                <ul class="aco-warnings" id="acoWarningList"></ul>
            </div>
            <div class="aco-actions">
                @if (acoCanEdit)
                {
                    <button class="pm-button" id="acoEditBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen"></i> Edit contract</button>
                    <button class="pm-button" id="acoNewVersionBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i> New version</button>
                    <button class="pm-button" id="acoStartRenewalBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Start renewal</button>
                }
                <button class="pm-button primary" id="acoOpenVersionBtn" type="button" hidden><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open"></i> Open version in progress</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-panel="VERSIONS" hidden>
            <div class="pm-toolbar">
                <select id="acoCmpA" title="Version A"></select>
                <select id="acoCmpB" title="Version B"></select>
                <button class="pm-button" id="acoCompareBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-compare"></i> Compare</button>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th><th>Effective</th><th>Value</th><th>Created</th><th>Approved</th><th>Replaces / replaced by</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoVersionsBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-panel="CONTACTS" hidden>
            @if (acoCanEdit)
            {
                <div class="pm-toolbar">
                    <button class="pm-button primary" id="acoContactNew" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i> Add vendor contact</button>
                </div>
            }
            <p class="aco-note">Vendor users are the third-party people linked to the vendor (Settings -> People). A new mapping is validated by another person; ending a mapping keeps it in the history.</p>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Contact</th><th>Primary</th><th>Effective</th><th>Status</th><th>Channel</th><th>Notifications</th><th>Applies to</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoContactsBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-panel="DOCUMENTS" hidden>
            <div class="pm-toolbar">
                <select id="acoDocVersion" title="Version"><option value="">All versions</option></select>
                <select id="acoDocType" title="Document type">
                    <option value="">All document types</option>
                    <option value="SIGNED_AGREEMENT">Signed agreement</option><option value="SCHEDULE">Schedule</option>
                    <option value="AMENDMENT">Amendment</option><option value="QUOTATION">Quotation</option>
                    <option value="PURCHASE_ORDER">Purchase order</option><option value="INVOICE">Invoice</option>
                    <option value="SUPPORTING_EVIDENCE">Supporting evidence</option><option value="OTHER">Other</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Type</th><th>Title</th><th>Reference</th><th>Status</th><th>Added</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoDocsBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-panel="APPROVALS" hidden>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Version</th><th>From</th><th>To</th><th>By</th><th>Action / reason</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoApprovalsBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-panel="COVERAGEHISTORY" hidden>
            <p class="aco-note">Assets and entitlements in each version; open a version for its lines.</p>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Status</th><th>Effective</th><th>Covered assets</th><th>Excluded</th><th>Suspended</th><th>Entitlements</th><th>Quantity</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoCoverageHistoryBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-panel="RENEWALHISTORY" hidden>
            <p class="aco-note">Renewal occurrences of this contract (separate from the version history); open one for its decision, approval and coverage reconciliation.</p>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Occurrence</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th><th>Old / new expiry</th><th>Value</th><th>Quotation / PO / invoice</th><th>Resulting version</th><th>Outcome</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoRenewalHistoryBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-aco-panel="CONTACTHISTORY" hidden>
            <p class="aco-note">The vendor contacts frozen with each approved version.</p>
            <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Role</th><th>Contact</th><th>Vendor</th><th>Primary</th><th>Effective</th><th>Channel</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="acoContactHistoryBody"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@* ======================= Contract header modal ======================= *@
<div class="pm-modal" id="acoEditModal" hidden>
    <div class="pm-modal-panel">
        <header>
            <h2 id="acoEditTitle">New contract</h2>
            <button class="pm-modal-close" type="button" data-close-aco="acoEditModal" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </header>
        <form id="acoEditForm" class="pm-form-grid">
            <label><span>Contract ID *</span><input type="text" id="acoEdNumber" maxlength="60" /></label>
            <label><span>Contract name *</span><input type="text" id="acoEdName" maxlength="250" /></label>
            <label><span>Contract type *</span><select id="acoEdType"></select></label>
            <label><span>Vendor *</span><select id="acoEdVendor"></select></label>
            <label class="full"><span>Parent agreement</span><select id="acoEdParent"></select></label>
            <label class="full"><span>Description</span><textarea id="acoEdDescription" rows="3" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label>
            <p class="aco-note full" id="acoEdLockNote" hidden>The vendor and contract type are fixed once a version has been approved.</p>
            <p class="aco-note full" id="acoEdNewNote">Version 1 (Initial) is created as a Draft; fill its dates, value and owners next.</p>
            <p class="pm-message full" id="acoEditMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <footer class="pm-modal-footer full">
                <button type="button" class="pm-button" data-close-aco="acoEditModal">Cancel</button>
                <button type="submit" class="pm-button primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save</button>
            </footer>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

@* ======================= New version modal ======================= *@
<div class="pm-modal" id="acoNewVersionModal" hidden>
    <div class="pm-modal-panel">
        <header>
            <h2>New contract version</h2>
            <button class="pm-modal-close" type="button" data-close-aco="acoNewVersionModal" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </header>
        <form id="acoNewVersionForm" class="pm-form-grid">
            <label class="full"><span>Version type *</span><select id="acoNvType">
                <option value="RENEWAL">Renewal</option><option value="AMENDMENT">Amendment</option><option value="EXTENSION">Extension</option>
                <option value="VARIATION">Variation</option><option value="CORRECTION">Correction</option><option value="TERMINATION">Termination</option>
                <option value="INITIAL">Initial (no approved version yet)</option>
            </select></label>
            <label class="full"><span>Change summary / reason *</span><textarea id="acoNvSummary" rows="3" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label>
            <p class="aco-note full">The draft starts as a copy of the version in force; that version stays in force until the new one is approved and reaches its effective date.</p>
            <p class="pm-message full" id="acoNewVersionMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <footer class="pm-modal-footer full">
                <button type="button" class="pm-button" data-close-aco="acoNewVersionModal">Cancel</button>
                <button type="submit" class="pm-button primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i> Create draft</button>
            </footer>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

@* ======================= Version details modal (7.2.1 / 7.2.3) ======================= *@
<div class="pm-modal" id="acoVersionModal" hidden>
    <div class="pm-modal-panel aco-wide">
        <header>
            <h2 id="acoVersionTitle">Contract version</h2>
            <button class="pm-modal-close" type="button" data-close-aco="acoVersionModal" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </header>
        <div class="aco-info" id="acoVersionInfo"></div>
        <form id="acoVersionForm" class="pm-form-grid">
            <h3 class="aco-sub full">Dates</h3>
            <label><span>Effective start *</span><input type="date" id="acoVfStart" /></label>
            <label><span>Effective end *</span><input type="date" id="acoVfEnd" /></label>
            <label><span>Notice date</span><input type="date" id="acoVfNotice" /></label>
            <label><span>Decision date</span><input type="date" id="acoVfDecision" /></label>
            <label><span id="acoVfTerminationLabel">Termination date</span><input type="date" id="acoVfTermination" /></label>
            <label><span>Version label</span><input type="text" id="acoVfLabel" maxlength="40" /></label>
            <h3 class="aco-sub full">Parties</h3>
            <label><span>Contract owner *</span><select id="acoVfOwner"></select></label>
            <label><span>Procurement owner</span><select id="acoVfProcurement"></select></label>
            <h3 class="aco-sub full">Commercial</h3>
            <label><span>Contract value</span><input type="number" id="acoVfValue" min="0" step="0.01" /></label>
            <label><span>Currency</span><input type="text" id="acoVfCurrency" maxlength="3" placeholder="INR" /></label>
            <label><span>Tax</span><input type="text" id="acoVfTax" maxlength="200" /></label>
            <label><span>Payment terms</span><input type="text" id="acoVfPayment" maxlength="400" /></label>
            <label><span>PO reference</span><input type="text" id="acoVfPo" maxlength="100" /></label>
            <label><span>Invoice reference</span><input type="text" id="acoVfInvoice" maxlength="100" /></label>
            <label class="full"><span>Cost allocation</span><input type="text" id="acoVfCost" maxlength="400" /></label>
            <label class="full"><span>Renewal terms</span><textarea id="acoVfRenewal" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
            <h3 class="aco-sub full">Service</h3>
            <label class="full"><span>Service scope</span><textarea id="acoVfScope" rows="2" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label>
            <label class="full"><span>SLA</span><textarea id="acoVfSla" rows="2" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label>
            <label><span>Support hours</span><input type="text" id="acoVfHours" maxlength="200" /></label>
            <label><span>Response time</span><input type="text" id="acoVfResponse" maxlength="100" /></label>
            <label><span>Resolution time</span><input type="text" id="acoVfResolution" maxlength="100" /></label>
            <label><span>Visits</span><input type="text" id="acoVfVisits" maxlength="100" /></label>
            <label class="full"><span id="acoVfSummaryLabel">Change summary / reason</span><textarea id="acoVfSummary" rows="2" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label>
            <div class="full" id="acoVfWarnings" hidden>
                <h3 class="aco-sub">Before approval</h3>
                <ul class="aco-warnings" id="acoVfWarningList"></ul>
            </div>
            <p class="pm-message full" id="acoVersionMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <footer class="pm-modal-footer full aco-actions" id="acoVersionActions"></footer>
        </form>
        <h3 class="aco-sub">Entitlements</h3>
        <div class="pm-form-grid" id="acoEntForm" hidden>
            <label><span>Product / SKU *</span><input type="text" id="acoEfSku" maxlength="160" /></label>
            <label><span>Coverage type *</span><select id="acoEfType"></select></label>
            <label><span>Quantity</span><input type="number" id="acoEfQty" min="0" step="0.01" /></label>
            <label><span>Unit</span><input type="text" id="acoEfUnit" maxlength="40" placeholder="devices, users, visits" /></label>
            <label><span>Service level</span><input type="text" id="acoEfLevel" maxlength="160" /></label>
            <label><span>Support hours</span><input type="text" id="acoEfHours" maxlength="200" /></label>
            <label><span>Start (blank = version dates)</span><input type="date" id="acoEfStart" /></label>
            <label><span>End (blank = version dates)</span><input type="date" id="acoEfEnd" /></label>
            <label class="full"><span>Description</span><input type="text" id="acoEfDesc" maxlength="400" /></label>
            <label class="full"><span>Exclusions</span><input type="text" id="acoEfExcl" maxlength="1000" /></label>
            <div class="full aco-actions">
                <button class="pm-button" id="acoEfSave" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> <span id="acoEfSaveLabel">Add entitlement</span></button>
                <button class="pm-button" id="acoEfCancel" type="button" hidden>Cancel edit</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pm-table-wrap">
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>Product / SKU</th><th>Coverage type</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Covered assets</th><th>Service level</th><th>Dates</th><th>Exclusions</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="acoVersionEnts"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <h3 class="aco-sub">Asset coverage</h3>
        <div id="acoCovForm" hidden>
            <div class="pm-toolbar">
                <input type="search" id="acoCfAssetSearch" placeholder="Search assets by name or ID" maxlength="200" />
                <select id="acoCfAssetType" title="Asset type"><option value="">All asset types</option></select>
                <select id="acoCfEnt" title="Entitlement"><option value="">No entitlement</option></select>
                <select id="acoCfCovType" title="Coverage type"></select>
                <button class="pm-button" id="acoCfFind" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i> Find</button>
                <button class="pm-button primary" id="acoCfAddSel" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Cover selected</button>
            </div>
